      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سرّى</span></b> , (K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سرّى سَرِيَّةً</span>, (TA,) inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسْرِيَةٌ</span>, <i>He</i> (the leader of an army, TA) <i>detached a</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرِيَّة</span> [q. v.] (K, TA) <i>to the enemy by night.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سرّى العَرَقَ عَنْ بَدَنِهِ</span>, inf. n. as above, <i>He exuded
the sweat from his body.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also 1,
last sentence, in two places.

